1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
1274 BC.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,670
Syria.

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:08,350
The most powerful man in the world is about to be ambushed.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,310
His name is Ramesses the Second.

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,830
Pharaoh of Egypt.

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,980
Son of the sun god.

7
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:15,770
Twenty-five years old.

8
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:19,050
And very, very sure of himself.

9
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:23,690
In a few hours, his army will be cut in half, his camp will be overrun,

10
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:26,950
and he will be fighting for his life.

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,410
And yet, when it was all over, he went home and carved his great victory into the

12
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,970
walls of five temples.

13
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,010
Meanwhile, the other king went home...

14
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:40,210
and recorded his victory too.

15
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,920
So who actually won the Battle of Kadesh?

